[00:07.64]Time feels like it's slipping away from me
{"时间仿佛正从我指缝间溜走"}
[00:14.24]Rewind to the days where we ran free
{"倒带回我们自由奔跑的时光"}
[00:20.77]Locked in where these colors fade back to gray
{"困在色彩褪回灰白的牢笼里"}
[00:27.29]But hold on 'cause Im going to break away
{"但请坚持 因为我即将挣脱"}
[00:31.63]I hear you calling for
{"我听见你在呼唤"}
[00:33.42]Me to lead my lights out and see through
{"让我点亮光芒穿透迷雾"}
[00:37.95]A sky that's bright now to meet you
{"此刻明亮的天空为与你相遇"}
[00:41.28]And make the stars come out
{"并让繁星重现天际"}
[00:45.77]Could I fix these
{"我能否修复这些"}
[00:47.97]Lost and fragmented pieces
{"失落破碎的残片"}
[00:51.34]Of forgotten hope that I needed
{"那些被我遗忘的必需希望"}
[00:54.55]And pretend they're not all gone?
{"假装它们并未全部消逝？"}
[00:59.15]Now I'm caught up in daydreams
{"如今我沉溺于白日梦中"}
[01:04.89]I'm falling down into this starlight stream
{"坠入这条星光照耀的溪流"}
[01:11.63]I didn't think that I would rather be high,
{"未曾想过我竟更渴望翱翔"}
[01:19.09]In skies that feel so far away from me
{"在那片遥不可及的天际"}
[01:24.85]Yeah, I'll make an escape
{"是的 我将逃离此地"}
[02:06.75]Float back to these oceans where I fall asleep
{"飘回让我安眠的海洋"}
[02:13.23]I swim up even though I drown into the deep
{"纵然沉入深渊仍奋力上浮"}
[02:19.57]Lights flick as the pendelum ceases swings
{"钟摆停摆时灯火明灭闪烁"}
[02:26.52]It's only seconds 'til these walls cave in
{"崩塌前只剩最后几秒"}
[02:30.67]I'm asking you to help wake me
{"我恳求你将我唤醒"}
[02:33.96]from these nightmares and save me
{"从梦魇中拯救我"}
[02:37.06]let my thoughts fade away to memories
{"让思绪化作褪色的记忆"}
[02:40.27]that all made perfect sense
{"那些曾经完美的意义"}
[02:45.03]Hyponotize me,
{"催眠我吧，"}
[02:46.00]This twilight where I can think clear
{"在这能清晰思考的暮色里"}
[02:50.51]And make this wish that you'll be here
{"许下心愿愿你在此地"}
[02:53.56]To stop these falling tears
{"止住这些滑落的泪滴"}
[02:58.10]Now I'm caught up in daydreams
{"此刻我沉溺于白日梦里"}
[03:04.00]I'm falling down into this starlight stream
{"坠入这片星光的河流里"}
[03:10.65]I didn't think that I would rather be high,
{"未曾想过我竟渴望沉醉，"}
[03:18.20]In skies that feel so far away from me
{"在那遥不可及的天际"}
[03:23.70]Yeah, I'll make an escape
{"是的　我将逃离此地"}
